 approved for use in your request.\n\nDesign description\nPlease refer to the URL at the bottom for the main design.\nThe following are characteristic elements.\nThe motif of her personality and atmosphere is \"friendly, kind, cute, and neat\". She is a pure and straight girl of high school age.\nShe has long, slender eyelashes and a girlish to slightly mature face.\nHer eyes are highlighted with yellow stars.\nThe hair ornament, tiara, and white fluffy ornaments on her head are all attached independently.\nThe back of her hair is gathered inward at the neck, and then parted outward around her back. The silhouette of the mid-back hair is intended to look like the wings of an angel.\nThe dress on the torso and the ruffles on the arms are independent decorations.\nThe long skirt of the dress is gradated from red to pale pink toward the bottom.\nThe front side of the white mini-skirt is decorated with three-tiered white ribbons and pearls at both ends.\nWe will leave all unknown points, omission or simplification of costumes and decorations to you.\n\n[Composition and pose]\nSD illustrations as specified during the appeal, please!\nDetailed interpretations of the above designs and methods of expression are left up to us. We will also leave all composition and poses up to you.\nThe general atmosphere we would like to see is that of a cute Lumieira-chan!\n\nUsage\nI would like to add the illustration to my Twitter moment. I may also use it for icons and headers.\nThe illustration may be quoted when making a request to a third party using the above moments.\n\nOther\nWe would like to receive the illustration in PSD format. We have PSD viewing environment.\n\nThank you very much for your time and consideration.\n\nReference Materials\nList Moments\nhttps://twitter.com/i/events/1504333386080731137\n\n\"Metelite Lumière\" Document\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1R_7FRbYG77T3sc0tkw8bWyffu4srwO1A?usp=sharing\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1R_7FRbYG77T3sc0tkw8bWyffu4srwO1A?usp=sharing", "nc": 25, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [{"path": "/@vakiponv/works/10", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2731669, "client_id": 1787377, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d51e550c/uploads/origins/3de5be50-cfd9-4938-9f73-6fd641d36988?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7dcea5ac6ddc5e6621de00ba9a28aa1c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d51e550c/uploads/origins/3de5be50-cfd9-4938-9f73-6fd641d36988?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7dcea5ac6ddc5e6621de00ba9a28aa1c, https://si.imgix.net/d51e550c/uploads/origins/3de5be50-cfd9-4938-9f73-6fd641d36988?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=08006ecbc9713f0ed39f5d8f7cdb83ab 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d51e550c/uploads/origins/3de5be50-cfd9-4938-9f73-6fd641d36988?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5af305058cf75ee0da46149893678250 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d51e550c/uploads/origins/3de5be50-cfd9-4938-9f73-6fd641d36988?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3b897e8bb2f3bf3d28aaa97e7343e0fe", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d51e550c/uploads/origins/3de5be50-cfd9-4938-9f73-6fd641d36988?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3b897e8bb2f3bf3d28aaa97e7343e0fe, https://si.imgix.net/d51e550c/uploads/origins/3de5be50-cfd9-4938-9f73-6fd641d36988?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f524138ef134eff8d53d782648880e7e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d51e550c/uploads/origins/3de5be50-cfd9-4938-9f73-6fd641d36988?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2288fde097a088e6ba2e0dbd49a62fc4 3x"}, "body": "Akiponさんのイラストいつも楽しみに拝見しております。\n今回は自創作の子を描いていただきたく、リクエストさせていただきました。\n\n⬛︎使用用途\n個人鑑賞用、TwitterやSNSなどでの使用\n\n⬛︎納品データに関して\nサイズや描写範囲はお任せいたします！\nPSD統合データの場合、人物だけの透過データを別途分けてくださると嬉しいです。\n\n(もし指定必要な場合は3:4などの縦長、頭〜腰元/全身希望です。あくまでおまかせ優先です！)\n\n⬛︎描いていただきたいキャラ\nhttps://x.com/motitaneyu/status/1739197626753659127?s=46&t=TKhIozVEiIrKtCD6XSSsVg\n\n自創作のユニコーンと人間のハーフの女の子です。\n容姿に関してはURL画像ご参照ください。\n\n⬛︎他容姿の詳細に関して\n画像のみでわかりづらかった際にご参照ください！\n*前髪部分に関して\n　正面から見て左の前髪は切るのを失敗しておりぱっつんになっております。\nまた白い毛に関しても左の方が短くなっています\n正面右は横流しで巻いています。\n\n*おめめ\n紫/ピンクベース(曖昧なのでご自由に！)\n\n*髪の毛\nピンクベースの白/水色メッシュです。\n髪型、前髪部分以外のメッシュは適当で構いません。\n\n*お洋服に関して\n詳細が決まっておらずもし余力ありましたらakiponさんのお好きな服を着せてくだされば幸いです。\n画像に近いお洋服でも色などもご自由にしてくださって構いません。\n\nもしお洋服仕立てていただける場合は好きな系統下記となりますのでもし悩んだ際は参照いただけますと幸いです><\nゆめかわ系/パステル系/白/ピンク/水色/量産型/甘ロリ/フリル\n\nキャラクター以外は基本おまかせで構いませんので、Akiponさんの好きな様に描いていただければ幸いです！\nもし描く物悩んだ際の参考に詳細はご確認ください。\n\nhttps://x.com/motitaneyu/status/1739197626753659127?s=46&t=TKhIozVEiIrKtCD6XSSsVg", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 187902, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "京谷", "screen_name": "kyouya0514", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1446497345835732992/bbXwiAst.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/875540238/1712058252/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 161}, {"id": 594304, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "ぽちろー🐼6/7コミティア【R06a】", "screen_name": "_PONPOC", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1991099069562015744/Id39x8FE.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1530784434/1